                                "example_id": "c065809a-b9ff-4798-870a-ad1ead0cc9ea",
                                "sense_id": "e04c8a73-0232-3aac-87f4-c92e00186924",
                                "text": "China has experienced significant socio-economic development over the past number of decades.",
                                "translation": "过去几十年来，中国经历了显著的社会经济发展。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ff95a589-6a09-41e7-8ecb-a144ac00bf71",
                                "sense_id": "e04c8a73-0232-3aac-87f4-c92e00186924",
                                "text": "Accordingly, the report advised that middle and higher-socioeconomic-strata neighborhoods should not fall at least within the one-mile and five-mile radii of the proposed site.",
                                "translation": "因此，报告建议，中、上社会经济阶层的社区至少不应分别位于拟建地点一英里和五英里半径范围内。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f62616b-530d-4319-883d-1a3eaf1bf6f5",
                                "sense_id": "e04c8a73-0232-3aac-87f4-c92e00186924",
                                "text": "This will benefit reopening projects that have wider network benefits - such as the Stratford-upon-Avon to Honeybourne section, which has wider socio-economic benefits that do not accrue to individual local authorities.",
                                "translation": "这将有利于重新开放具有更广泛网络效益的项目——例如埃文河畔斯特拉特福至霍尼伯恩路段，该路段具有更广泛的社会经济效益，而这些效益并不归属于各个地方当局。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
